      },
      "message": "fix(import): refuse STEP records nested past 64 parentheses before parsing\n\nruststep's recursive-descent parser overflows the stack on a DATA record\nnested about 400 deep (debug, 1 MiB) to 1086 (release, 2 MiB), taking the\nprocess down. A linear byte pre-scan (geometry::import::step_depth) tracks\ndepth outside strings and comments and refuses past MAX_NESTING = 64,\nnaming the cap, the entity #id and the line. Called first by\nstep::parse_with_chord (every model import) and step_csys::read_tool_csys.\n\nFixes #1075\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
